.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
integer sequences for whether they are consecutive\&.

.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
SKM 
.RE
.PP
\fBDate\fP
.RS 4
10/12/2016
.RE
.PP
.IP "1." 4
Finds the max­i­mum and min­i­mum ele­ments in sequences
.IP "2." 4
Checks if the sequence length = max-min+1
.IP "3." 4
Checks if the sequence contains duplicates
.IP "4." 4
checks whether the elements of the sequence are consecutuve
.PP

.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
current implementation is restricted to size_t unsigned integers\&.

.PP
use \fBTest_ConsecutiveSequenceChecker()\fP to see verification of methods\&. 
.RE
.PP

