.SS "template<> bool ConsecutiveSequenceChecker::IsValueRangeOfUnsignedIntConsecutive (const multimap< string, \fBvector\fP< size_t > > & immap, bool check_whether_max_value_is_size_minus1)"
checks whether the values of a map are in consecutive order

.PP
.IP "1." 4
checks the individual element ranges for duplicates\&.
.IP "2." 4
combines these ranges into a single one and tests that it is consecutive\&. 
.PP

